#N canvas 200 200 900 600 12;
#X text 20 10 Lab hat: six squares at clashing pitches (the 808 recipe) plus noise \, band-passed (tone \, focus) and high-passed (low cut) \, then drive. Closed and open share it: only the length changes.;
